<title>USA: CompuServe opens Mexico office.</title>
<headline>CompuServe opens Mexico office.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompuServe Corp's network services division said it has opened an office in Mexico to support its business customers.</p>
<p>The company said this is its first office in Mexico and is part of its expansion in Latin America.</p>
<p>&quot;Mexico is a critically important market for business and continues to grow in importance in the world economy,&quot; Peter Van Camp, executive vice president of network services, said in a statement.</p>
<p>CompuServe Network Services has offered access to its global network in Mexico since 1994.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
